---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"service\")"
---
Manage the Linux systemd --user unit that runs `dreamd watch`

Usage: service <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Write a systemd --user unit for `dreamd watch` and enable it now (Linux only)
  start    Run `systemctl --user start dreamd.service` (Linux only)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
